title: Remove deprecated build-spec CLI subcommand
doc:
- audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
  description: |-
    Remove the deprecated `build-spec` subcommand and `BuildSpecCmd` from `sc-cli`;
    use `export-chain-spec` instead.

    - `export-chain-spec` no longer defaults `--chain` to `local`; pass it explicitly.
    - `export-chain-spec` has no `--dev` and adds no default bootnode; use `--chain dev`.
    - `polkadot-omni-node` has no `export-chain-spec`; use `chain-spec-builder` instead.
crates:
- name: sc-cli
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-cli
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: major
- name: staging-chain-spec-builder
  bump: patch
- name: sc-transaction-pool
  bump: none
